This is installed in owncloud as an app of type theme.

It is less about making a custom theme in owncloud, but more about modifying
owncloud behaviour within the extent of a theme app. The main purpose of this
app is to modify the login page of owncloud to match the desired login
workflow: login on the landing page, which login directly to owncloud; if
success, then redirect to owncloud files page; if fail, the login page again

The shiny, pre-login web frontend is in another repo, by another dev.
